1a:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["The EMI formula is simple; the discipline is in comparing ",["$","em",null,{"children":"total interest"}],",\nnot just the monthly figure. Two offers with nearly identical EMIs can differ\nby lakhs over the life of the loan. Run both through the calculator, look at\nthe interest total, and let that decide."]}]
